title: Windows Update Tracker: Failed installations
agents: windows
catalog: os/misc
license: GPLv2
distribution: https://github.com/KeksDipp/checkmk-plugins
description:
 Shows failed Windows update installations of the last 30 days
 (default: {WARN}).

 The service goes back to {OK} when the update was installed successfully
 later or is no longer offered (e.g. replaced by a newer update).
 Installations still in progress are not counted.

discovery:
 One service is created if the agent plugin output is present.
